{
    "title": "VIN Check Report for Used Cars",
    "description": "VINDecoded.com for Android \u2013 try the most accurate and thorough VIN Checker and FREE VIN Report. Getting a free vin check of any used car has never been this easy and detailed!\r\n\r\nShopping for a used car and looking for a car report? Car Shopping for a used cars is now easier! VIN Decoded has you covered. Our advanced vehicle finder + VIN checker performs a thorough VIN check and Market Value Report for your used car buying process.\r\n\r\n<b>SUPER DETAILED REPORT FOR ANY USED CAR</b>\r\nVINDecoded has already helped hundreds of thousands vehicle owners and enthusiasts to get the correct information for their desired vehicle. Now it\u2019s your turn to perform an easy VIN lookup and get detailed used car reporting for your car buying process.  A great tool for comparing cars and getting the most accurate value of the vehicle compared to other used cars for sale!\r\n\r\nScan your VIN barcode or Enter the VIN and get a full vehicle detail report, including:\r\n\r\n\u25cb Market Value Report +  Blue Book Value for Vehicle Value compared to other used cars for sale in retail & auto auction\r\n\u25cb Used Car Listing History for any VIN to view past car prices for the vehicle, and what dealership it was for sale at and when it was listed.\r\n\u25cb Year, Make, Model, Engine, Style, Drive, Transmission, Measurements, and more from our built in VIN Decoder and VIN Lookup tool\r\n\u25cb Safety Rating as provided by the NHTSA\r\n\u25cb Car Insurance Quotes\r\n\u25cb NICB Car Stolen and Total Loss Check\r\n\u25cb Vehicle History Report Options - including VINAudit and Carfax!\r\n\u25cb Open and Completed Recalls as provided by the NHTSA\r\n\u25cb Maintenance schedule for the car - including oil change, tire rotations, transmission fluids, + more\r\n\u25cb Deals on Automotive parts and tires\r\n\u25cb Service Bulletins as provided by the NHTSA\r\n\r\n<b>EASY PROCESS</b>\r\nScan your VIN with the built in VIN Barcode Scanner and VIN Code + VIN Decoder, then view the VIN details. It\u2019s that easy!\r\n\r\n<b>GREAT TOOL FOR CAR BUYING</b>\r\nBesides being excellent for vin number check and as check vin solutions platform, VINDecoded is perfect for buying cars too. Get Kelley Blue Book (KBB) and Edmunds Vehicle Values! Great for Wholesale purchasing and auctions, or just buying used cars, trade ins, trade-in, and certified pre-owned vehicles! \r\n\r\nGet a leg out on those pesky used car salesman by knowing what similar cars are for sale and seeing how your car compares.  While KBB, Edmund, and NADA give you estimated values, we actually compare the car you are looking at to other vehicles that have been sold and are for sale to give you the most accurate used car value available! \r\nVINDecoded works great in conjunction with car gurus, Truecar, Carmax, Autolist, and more to run a car compare report.\r\n\r\n<b>DETAILED CAR HISTORY</b>\r\nVehicle History Reports are available from VINAudit.com and CARFAX. See the Car's Vehicle History including Title Records, Junk Records, Salvage Records, Insurance Records, Theft & Stolen Records, Collision & Total Loss Records, and more. Stay informed on Used Cars History.\r\n\r\nNow includes CARFAX Reports!\r\n\r\n<b>OTHER FEATURES</b>\r\n- Decode ALL VINs with our VIN checker including but not limited to Ford, Nissan, Honda, Toyota, Dodge, PSA Peugeot Citroen, Fiat, Chrysler, Hyundai, Kia, General Motors, Volkswagen, Chevrolet, Harley Davidson, GMC, VAG, GM, Porsche and BMW\r\n- KBB values are included for used car value checker\r\n-AutoZone links included for parts to understand how to purchase AutoZone parts directly for your car, truck, or automotive needs!\r\n- Great tool for tow trucks!\r\n- Loan Calculator\r\n- Vehicle Maintenance, Recalls, Options, NHTSA Bulletins, Specs\r\n- Vehicle History Report Available - comparable to AutoCheck\r\n- History of previously scanned VINs\r\n\r\nWith VIN Decoded advanced integrated VIN barcode scanner for used cars be sure to get accurate data and vehicle history!  The easiest VIN Decode tool around!  Easily the most information for an automobile that is available!\r\n\r\n---- > Get our vin decoder for the best vin number check of used cars!",
    "descriptionHTML": "VINDecoded.com for Android \u2013 try the most accurate and thorough VIN Checker and FREE VIN Report. Getting a free vin check of any used car has never been this easy and detailed!<br><br>Shopping for a used car and looking for a car report? Car Shopping for a used cars is now easier! VIN Decoded has you covered. Our advanced vehicle finder + VIN checker performs a thorough VIN check and Market Value Report for your used car buying process.<br><br><b>SUPER DETAILED REPORT FOR ANY USED CAR</b><br>VINDecoded has already helped hundreds of thousands vehicle owners and enthusiasts to get the correct information for their desired vehicle. Now it\u2019s your turn to perform an easy VIN lookup and get detailed used car reporting for your car buying process.  A great tool for comparing cars and getting the most accurate value of the vehicle compared to other used cars for sale!<br><br>Scan your VIN barcode or Enter the VIN and get a full vehicle detail report, including:<br><br>\u25cb Market Value Report +  Blue Book Value for Vehicle Value compared to other used cars for sale in retail &amp; auto auction<br>\u25cb Used Car Listing History for any VIN to view past car prices for the vehicle, and what dealership it was for sale at and when it was listed.<br>\u25cb Year, Make, Model, Engine, Style, Drive, Transmission, Measurements, and more from our built in VIN Decoder and VIN Lookup tool<br>\u25cb Safety Rating as provided by the NHTSA<br>\u25cb Car Insurance Quotes<br>\u25cb NICB Car Stolen and Total Loss Check<br>\u25cb Vehicle History Report Options - including VINAudit and Carfax!<br>\u25cb Open and Completed Recalls as provided by the NHTSA<br>\u25cb Maintenance schedule for the car - including oil change, tire rotations, transmission fluids, + more<br>\u25cb Deals on Automotive parts and tires<br>\u25cb Service Bulletins as provided by the NHTSA<br><br><b>EASY PROCESS</b><br>Scan your VIN with the built in VIN Barcode Scanner and VIN Code + VIN Decoder, then view the VIN details. It\u2019s that easy!<br><br><b>GREAT TOOL FOR CAR BUYING</b><br>Besides being excellent for vin number check and as check vin solutions platform, VINDecoded is perfect for buying cars too. Get Kelley Blue Book (KBB) and Edmunds Vehicle Values! Great for Wholesale purchasing and auctions, or just buying used cars, trade ins, trade-in, and certified pre-owned vehicles! <br><br>Get a leg out on those pesky used car salesman by knowing what similar cars are for sale and seeing how your car compares.  While KBB, Edmund, and NADA give you estimated values, we actually compare the car you are looking at to other vehicles that have been sold and are for sale to give you the most accurate used car value available! <br>VINDecoded works great in conjunction with car gurus, Truecar, Carmax, Autolist, and more to run a car compare report.<br><br><b>DETAILED CAR HISTORY</b><br>Vehicle History Reports are available from VINAudit.com and CARFAX. See the Car&#39;s Vehicle History including Title Records, Junk Records, Salvage Records, Insurance Records, Theft &amp; Stolen Records, Collision &amp; Total Loss Records, and more. Stay informed on Used Cars History.<br><br>Now includes CARFAX Reports!<br><br><b>OTHER FEATURES</b><br>- Decode ALL VINs with our VIN checker including but not limited to Ford, Nissan, Honda, Toyota, Dodge, PSA Peugeot Citroen, Fiat, Chrysler, Hyundai, Kia, General Motors, Volkswagen, Chevrolet, Harley Davidson, GMC, VAG, GM, Porsche and BMW<br>- KBB values are included for used car value checker<br>-AutoZone links included for parts to understand how to purchase AutoZone parts directly for your car, truck, or automotive needs!<br>- Great tool for tow trucks!<br>- Loan Calculator<br>- Vehicle Maintenance, Recalls, Options, NHTSA Bulletins, Specs<br>- Vehicle History Report Available - comparable to AutoCheck<br>- History of previously scanned VINs<br><br>With VIN Decoded advanced integrated VIN barcode scanner for used cars be sure to get accurate data and vehicle history!  The easiest VIN Decode tool around!  Easily the most information for an automobile that is available!<br><br>---- &gt; Get our vin decoder for the best vin number check of used cars!",
